Package: tinylogin
Version: 1.4-r1
Description: TinyLogin is a suite of tiny UNIX utilities for handling logins, user authentication, changing passwords, and otherwise maintaining users and groups on an embedded system.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://tinylogin.busybox.net/downloads/tinylogin-1.4.tar.bz2 	file://cvs-20040608.patch;patch=1;pnum=1 	file://add-system.patch;patch=1;pnum=1
Depends: tinylogin, libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726), libgcc1 (>= 3.4.1)
